1. mpi
save the mpi pgm in mpi_max.py then run these cmds in terminal
sudo apt update
sudo apt install openmpi-bin libopenmpi-dev python3-venv -y
python3 -m venv ~/mpi-env
source ~/mpi-env/bin/activate
pip install mpi4py
cd (file path)
mpirun --oversubscribe -np 2 python mpi_max.py

2.
save the openmp pgm in openmp_max.cpp and run these cmds in terminal
sudo apt update
sudo apt install g++ libomp-dev -y
cd (file location)
g++ -fopenmp openmp_max.cpp -o openmp_max.out
./openmp_max.out